        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1373708457,
        "heading": "Poison",
        "text": "The glycosides prulaurasin and amygdalin, which can be poisonous to some mammals, are present in some parts of P. padus, including the leaves, stems and fruit.",
